OL,3,ASports Direct founder attacks Burnham's
OL,4,A'populist' High Street plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FSports Direct founder Mike Ashley has
OL,7,Fcriticised Prime Minister Andy
OL,8,FBurnham's cost of living and retail
OL,9,Fpolicies as "populist".
OL,11,FIn a letter to Burnham, Ashley accused
OL,12,Fhim of "jumping on 'everyday fixes' or
OL,13,Fbandwagons" while businesses struggled
OL,14,Fwith the government's "disastrous"
OL,15,Fbusiness rates policies and higher
OL,16,Femployment costs.
OL,18,FHe also described a proposal to
OL,19,Fincrease business rates on large
OL,20,Fwarehouses in order to help reduce
OL,21,Frates for pubs and clubs as
OL,22,F"delusional".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
